    <description>Kadal Deck for desktop: your decks and dashboard (sign in with Google or GitHub through your browser), decks kept offline for when the venue Wi-Fi dies, deck folders on your computer presented straight from source, and a frameless share window that follows the presenter view: the one window to share on a call instead of your screen. It updates itself in the background, checking each update against Kadal's signature.

The installer is not Authenticode-signed yet; it is downloaded from deck.kadal.cc and checked against the SHA-256 in this package before it runs.</description>
